WEBVTT

00:01.790 --> 00:05.420
The winged knights launch
repeated assaults on Castle Thor,

00:05.420 --> 00:06.920
while Hyura and the other demonkin

00:06.920 --> 00:09.670
fight arduously to fend them off
in a never-ending cycle.

00:10.080 --> 00:11.290
Meanwhile,

00:11.290 --> 00:14.130
Vermilio and company make their way
through a barren desert.

00:14.130 --> 00:16.500
One night, Helck offers his sword to Vermilio

00:16.500 --> 00:19.580
revealing its true nature as
the weapon known as "Hero Slayer."

00:20.750 --> 00:24.960
Listen, I'm going to tell you about my past,
the power of heroes,

00:24.960 --> 00:29.210
and everything else that happened
in the human realm.

00:29.420 --> 00:33.750
Then once you've heard the story,
I'd like you to consider doing me this favor.

00:53.500 --> 00:56.040
Ah, displaying strength like it was totally natural

00:56.040 --> 00:58.210
Feelings of inferiority growing deeper

00:58.210 --> 01:00.170
From the moment of birth

01:00.170 --> 01:02.330
Let them know that it's a done deal

01:02.330 --> 01:04.130
The neighbor to utopia

01:04.130 --> 01:06.330
Despair is saying "hello," ya see

01:06.330 --> 01:08.380
The fact that nobody notices

01:08.380 --> 01:10.540
Is it for better or worse?

01:10.540 --> 01:13.750
No matter how many times I wake up

01:13.750 --> 01:16.880
It's like I'm in a nightmare

01:16.880 --> 01:20.250
If suffering is all there is

01:20.580 --> 01:22.380
Then God could you please

01:22.380 --> 01:26.290
Consider remaking me from scratch?

01:26.290 --> 01:28.420
Ah, for many thousands of years we have

01:28.420 --> 01:31.000
Been holding out hope for the future

01:31.000 --> 01:32.880
The end is bound to come no matter what

01:32.880 --> 01:35.170
And we try to resist it

01:35.170 --> 01:36.830
How many prayers is this now?

01:36.830 --> 01:39.170
Body and soul completely transformed

01:39.170 --> 01:43.580
Just wanting to believe in something even if it's fake

01:43.710 --> 01:47.130
Huh? Am I alive right now?

01:47.130 --> 01:49.880
I don't even know anymore

01:49.880 --> 01:51.880
Help me, I need to be saved

02:05.040 --> 02:09.960
<b>With Younger Brother in Tow</b>

02:10.580 --> 02:12.290
Here. Today's earnings.

02:12.540 --> 02:14.500
What? Just some bread?

02:14.170 --> 02:16.830
<b>Helck (Age 8)</b>

02:14.500 --> 02:16.580
But I worked so hard...

02:16.880 --> 02:18.710
Times are tough for everybody, kid!

02:18.710 --> 02:20.080
Please, you gotta help me out!

02:20.080 --> 02:21.130
Put a sock in it!

02:21.130 --> 02:23.460
Don't bother coming back
if you're just gonna whine!

02:23.460 --> 02:24.920
I'm sorry...

02:28.080 --> 02:29.960
No! Please stop it!

02:29.960 --> 02:31.540
That hurts!

02:33.630 --> 02:35.960
<b>Cless (Age 4)</b>

02:34.250 --> 02:35.500
Get a grip!

02:35.500 --> 02:38.130
You better use that thing to block me
unless you wanna die!

02:39.540 --> 02:40.500
Ouch!

02:40.500 --> 02:41.710
Come on!

02:41.710 --> 02:44.210
Take this! And this!

02:45.500 --> 02:46.710
Please stop it!

02:46.710 --> 02:47.670
Big Bro!

02:48.580 --> 02:49.880
Look who's here.

02:49.880 --> 02:53.040
What? You gonna defy our orders now, punk?

02:53.630 --> 02:55.080
There's no chance of that happening.

02:55.080 --> 02:57.380
Yeah, nobody would dare talk back to us!

02:57.380 --> 02:59.000
That's what I thought.

02:59.000 --> 03:01.130
Get on the bad side of nobility like us,

03:01.130 --> 03:02.710
and we'll make sure

03:02.710 --> 03:05.750
you and all the other pieces of human trash
around here get beaten to a bloody pulp.

03:06.170 --> 03:07.540
I won't defy you.

03:08.500 --> 03:11.830
But if you want to hit someone,
then please hit me.

03:11.830 --> 03:13.500
Oh, yeah?

03:13.500 --> 03:15.080
Then don't mind if I do.

03:16.170 --> 03:17.380
Big Bro!

03:19.580 --> 03:20.670
Weakling!

03:21.170 --> 03:22.330
Have a taste of this!

03:22.920 --> 03:24.170
Big Bro...

03:24.710 --> 03:27.290
My younger brother and I
grew up as orphans.

03:29.920 --> 03:33.830
When I was just six years old,
a monster suddenly appeared in our village,

03:33.830 --> 03:36.380
and took the lives of our mother and father.

03:37.130 --> 03:41.420
The village was ravaged.
There was no hope of rebuilding it.

03:44.540 --> 03:47.170
Cless, we're still alive.

03:47.170 --> 03:48.380
And no matter what happens,

03:48.380 --> 03:50.880
we're going to keep on
living for Mom and Dad's sake.

03:51.330 --> 03:53.710
Daddy... Mommy...!

03:53.710 --> 03:55.080
It's all right.

03:55.290 --> 03:57.170
I'm here for you, okay?

03:57.170 --> 03:59.790
I'm going to keep you safe!

04:01.750 --> 04:03.710
We headed for the royal capital.

04:03.960 --> 04:05.500
Because we figured

04:05.500 --> 04:09.080
if any place would have a job
that even kids could do, it would be there.

04:11.710 --> 04:12.710
Take this, loser!

04:12.710 --> 04:13.750
But it turned out

04:13.750 --> 04:16.750
the royal capital was vastly different
from the promised land we imagined.

04:17.040 --> 04:18.920
Economic disparity
was sharply on the rise,

04:18.920 --> 04:23.210
and those who were poor got treated worse
than livestock by the wealthy and affluent.

04:23.880 --> 04:26.880
But in spite of all that, the two of us
decided that's where we would live.

04:26.880 --> 04:30.040
Our home was on the outskirts
of the capital, in the slums.

04:30.460 --> 04:32.000
It was a dismal and unsanitary place,

04:32.000 --> 04:34.960
with hardly a scrap of food
to be found anywhere.

04:35.290 --> 04:38.000
But compared to living with the
danger of being attacked by monsters,

04:38.000 --> 04:39.750
it seemed like the far better option.

04:39.750 --> 04:40.710
Hiyah!

04:42.750 --> 04:44.830
Damn, he's a tough little turd.

04:44.830 --> 04:46.920
My wooden sword actually snapped in two.

04:46.920 --> 04:48.250
Let's go somewhere else.

04:48.250 --> 04:50.210
I don't want their stink
to get on my clothes.

04:50.210 --> 04:50.830
Okay.

04:50.960 --> 04:52.750
See you later, worm boy!

04:53.540 --> 04:54.580
Big Bro!

04:54.580 --> 04:57.500
Getting abused by members of nobility
was a part of everyday life.

04:57.500 --> 04:59.460
But I didn't care as long as Cless was safe.

04:59.460 --> 05:02.460
I would let them tease me
and beat me all they wanted.

05:02.460 --> 05:04.040
Are you okay, Big Bro?

05:04.040 --> 05:05.920
Yeah. Don't worry about me.

05:07.630 --> 05:09.670
I'm sorry, Big Bro!

05:09.670 --> 05:12.460
I never should have looked them in the eyes!

05:12.460 --> 05:14.960
Enough crying. You need to man up, Cless.

05:15.380 --> 05:18.170
I would protect Cless no matter what it took.

05:18.170 --> 05:19.960
That was the one thing I swore to myself.

05:19.960 --> 05:23.080
But you're all bloody and messed up
because of me...

05:23.080 --> 05:25.290
I mean, you could say the same
about yourself.

05:25.290 --> 05:27.920
You're in way worse shape than I am!

05:27.920 --> 05:31.460
I told you not to worry!
You know I'm built tough, right?

05:31.580 --> 05:33.290
Go on. Take a good look.

05:34.670 --> 05:35.960
Super recovery mode.

05:35.960 --> 05:37.920
Gosh, you're so amazing, Big Bro!

05:38.880 --> 05:39.920
Wait a damn minute!

05:39.920 --> 05:41.830
You could do that
when you were just a kid?!

05:41.830 --> 05:43.330
Yep! It came to me naturally.

05:43.330 --> 05:47.040
Hold up, that must mean you had
already awakened your hero powers!

05:47.040 --> 05:49.500
Thinking back on it, you're probably right.

05:49.670 --> 05:51.040
But at the time,

05:51.040 --> 05:54.250
I just thought of myself as being
a little more durable than everybody else.

05:55.500 --> 05:57.460
I wonder when it happened...

05:57.460 --> 06:01.170
I actually don't remember anything
about when I first awakened my powers.

06:01.290 --> 06:04.460
Does that mean he awakened
when he was still just a baby?

06:04.460 --> 06:07.380
In which case, he developed
and matured while totally free

06:07.380 --> 06:09.080
from any of the usual human limitations.

06:09.080 --> 06:11.130
No wonder he's crazy strong.

06:13.000 --> 06:14.960
Sorry about that. Please continue.

06:14.960 --> 06:17.040
Okay, but would you like
more hot cocoa first?

06:17.040 --> 06:18.790
Oh... yes, please.

06:20.040 --> 06:22.210
They continued to torment us
more after that.

06:23.670 --> 06:26.380
Sometimes our food would get
thrown into the river.

06:26.380 --> 06:29.670
And our home would get ransacked
or lit on fire.

06:29.790 --> 06:32.920
There were even times the harassment
from drunk nobles was so bad

06:32.920 --> 06:34.130
I thought they'd kill me.

06:34.290 --> 06:35.750
And on some days,

06:35.750 --> 06:38.790
the meager wages that I had worked
to earn would get taken right from me.

06:38.790 --> 06:43.000
Despite all of that, leaving the
royal capital wasn't an option for us.

06:43.420 --> 06:46.380
Monsters had been spawning
outside of the city in great numbers,

06:46.380 --> 06:49.210
bringing chaos and death in their wake.

06:49.210 --> 06:54.830
So no matter how bad the abuse was,
we had no choice except to stay in the capital.

06:56.580 --> 06:59.710
Nonetheless, our outlook
was always optimistic.

06:59.710 --> 07:01.710
Cless! Bad news!

07:01.710 --> 07:03.670
I only got paid in bread today!

07:03.790 --> 07:05.500
But it's filled with cheese!

07:05.500 --> 07:06.420
Hooray!

07:06.420 --> 07:09.130
That's not all!
I managed to barter for some eggs, too!

07:09.130 --> 07:11.380
Wow, you're so good at bartering!

07:11.380 --> 07:13.630
Such noisy little brats.

07:15.460 --> 07:18.290
I didn't want to sour the mood
by being gloomy.

07:19.290 --> 07:22.290
Cless, the day will come when
there are less monsters around,

07:22.290 --> 07:23.580
and that's when we'll leave.

07:23.580 --> 07:25.330
The two of us will set out on a journey.

07:25.330 --> 07:26.420
A journey?

07:26.420 --> 07:27.500
Yep.

07:27.880 --> 07:30.250
We'll travel the world
until we find a peaceful place

07:30.250 --> 07:32.710
where we can live
without being harassed by anyone.

07:34.420 --> 07:35.670
Okay!

07:35.670 --> 07:39.750
I didn't need a rich and fancy lifestyle.
I just wanted to be with Cless.

07:39.750 --> 07:42.710
As long as the two of us could live happily,
then that was more than enough for me.

07:43.210 --> 07:47.580
But sadly, another tragic event
was waiting for us just around the corner.

07:48.630 --> 07:50.500
Seems like your little brother's immune system
was in poor shape due to malnutrition.

07:50.500 --> 07:53.040
Cless! Hang in there, Cless!
Seems like your little brother's immune system<b>
</b>was in poor shape due to malnutrition.<b></b>

07:53.040 --> 07:53.460
Cless! Hang in there, Cless!

07:53.460 --> 07:54.040
Cless! Hang in there, Cless!
He's too young to survive an illness like this.<b></b>

07:54.040 --> 07:55.920
He's too young to survive an illness like this.

07:55.920 --> 07:57.000
Cless!

07:57.000 --> 07:58.960
He won't last through the night.

07:59.210 --> 08:01.420
No way!
There must be something you can do!

08:01.420 --> 08:05.040
Don't look at me.
I'm not even a doctor, kid.

08:05.790 --> 08:09.670
This is my fault.
I should have done more to keep him fed!

08:09.670 --> 08:11.330
Then he'd be okay!

08:11.330 --> 08:15.210
Don't blame yourself.
That's just how life goes around here.

08:15.460 --> 08:17.330
He's not the only one, you know.

08:17.330 --> 08:19.750
You just gotta chalk it up
to fate and move on.

08:20.210 --> 08:21.500
To hell with fate!

08:21.500 --> 08:23.920
I won't accept it!
I'm not letting Cless die!

08:24.420 --> 08:27.330
Hang tight, Cless.
I'm going to bring a doctor for you right away!

08:27.710 --> 08:28.920
Don't waste your time!

08:28.920 --> 08:31.330
I mean, what can you hope to accomplish
without any money?

08:31.330 --> 08:34.000
I have some that I saved up
for when we were ready to move.

08:36.000 --> 08:38.710
Wait! You shouldn't get your hopes up!

08:38.710 --> 08:41.170
Nobody's gonna go out of their way
to save bottom of the barrel folks like us!

08:41.170 --> 08:44.460
Especially since plenty of them
think we're better off dead in a ditch!

08:44.460 --> 08:46.420
Come back! Just give up!

08:48.380 --> 08:50.420
I knew the old-timer had a point.

08:50.420 --> 08:51.460
But even so,

08:51.460 --> 08:54.790
there was no way I was just going
to stand by and watch Cless die.

08:54.790 --> 08:55.540
I went to house after house.

08:55.540 --> 08:57.040
Excuse me! Please open up!
I went to house after house.<b></b>

08:57.040 --> 08:58.250
My little brother is sick!

08:58.420 --> 08:58.920
I don't care. Go away!

08:58.920 --> 09:00.250
Knocking on door after door.
I don't care. Go away!<b></b>

09:00.250 --> 09:01.130
Get lost!

09:01.130 --> 09:03.080
Begging for help over and over.
The less of you bums there are<b>
</b>stinking up the slums, the better!<b></b>

09:03.080 --> 09:04.500
The less of you bums there are
stinking up the slums, the better!

09:04.500 --> 09:05.420
But...

09:05.420 --> 09:06.710
If you want money, I have some!

09:06.710 --> 09:09.830
And if that's not enough, I swear on my life
I'll bring you more in a day or two!

09:09.830 --> 09:12.540
I'm begging you!
Please just take a look at my brother!

09:13.040 --> 09:15.750
Hey, kid. How'd you get all that money?

09:15.750 --> 09:16.920
Huh?

09:17.080 --> 09:20.000
There's no way some brat from the slums
would have this kind of money.

09:20.000 --> 09:21.630
Where'd you steal it from?!

09:21.630 --> 09:22.790
B-but I didn't!

09:22.790 --> 09:24.500
I've been earning it
little by little each day...

09:24.500 --> 09:26.250
Hey! Call the guards!

09:26.250 --> 09:27.420
We've got a thief here!

09:27.420 --> 09:28.420
No...

09:28.420 --> 09:29.670
No!

09:34.670 --> 09:36.580
I kept on trying.

09:36.580 --> 09:38.540
I didn't want to give up.

09:38.670 --> 09:39.670
Big Bro...

09:39.670 --> 09:41.790
Sorry about this, Cless.

09:41.790 --> 09:43.710
Just hold on a little longer.

09:43.960 --> 09:46.630
I'm sorry... Big Bro...

09:46.630 --> 09:48.880
I'm always causing trouble for you...

09:49.580 --> 09:50.880
Don't be silly.

09:50.880 --> 09:54.080
You've never caused me trouble before.
Not even once.

09:54.250 --> 09:55.500
Keep your spirits up.

09:55.500 --> 09:58.000
I'm definitely going to find you
a doctor, okay?

09:58.000 --> 09:59.330
Okay...

10:00.000 --> 10:02.670
What do you say we leave here
once the weather warms up?

10:03.130 --> 10:06.380
It's hard to get our hands on
any food these days.

10:06.580 --> 10:08.920
And since we get harassed all the time,

10:08.920 --> 10:12.420
things might actually be better
if we tried living with the monsters!

10:16.250 --> 10:17.670
Remember what I told you before?

10:17.670 --> 10:20.000
About how we'd travel
and find a peaceful place?

10:20.000 --> 10:21.750
That's where we'll live.

10:21.750 --> 10:25.540
I know the monsters and bandits
might be scary, but it'll be okay!

10:25.540 --> 10:28.210
I'm gonna put on muscle
until I'm strong enough to beat them,

10:28.210 --> 10:29.920
and then send them all packing!

10:30.540 --> 10:31.630
Big Bro...

10:31.630 --> 10:34.830
I'm always going to be there
to protect you, okay?

10:37.880 --> 10:39.080
Cless?

10:45.080 --> 10:48.000
Stay with me!
You can't die in a place like this!

10:48.000 --> 10:49.750
I started running frantically.

10:49.750 --> 10:51.830
And sought help from anyone who I came across.

10:52.330 --> 10:55.380
Somebody help! Please, I need help!

10:55.380 --> 10:57.210
My little brother is sick!

10:57.420 --> 11:00.500
I have some money!
Please take me to a doctor!

11:00.500 --> 11:01.420
I'm begging you!

11:01.420 --> 11:04.210
My brother needs help!
Somebody please save Cless!

11:05.420 --> 11:07.420
Goddamn slum vermin!

11:07.880 --> 11:09.710
Don't spread your diseases around here!

11:09.710 --> 11:11.500
Go back where you came from!

11:11.790 --> 11:13.210
Please help...

11:14.750 --> 11:17.540
Please... help Cless...

11:18.540 --> 11:20.960
Dammit! Dammit...

11:21.920 --> 11:24.630
Hey, little guy. What's the matter?

11:35.330 --> 11:36.710
What's the matter?

11:36.880 --> 11:38.040
A noble...

11:38.420 --> 11:41.540
You were shouting just a minute ago.
What's going on?

11:42.080 --> 11:44.670
My little brother is close to dying
because of an illness.

11:44.670 --> 11:46.630
I need help! Please!

11:46.630 --> 11:48.040
Save my brother...

11:52.420 --> 11:54.670
She just wanted to torment me...

11:54.670 --> 11:57.040
Dammit... Dammit!

11:57.580 --> 12:00.460
Hey, Father! Listen! It's an emergency!

12:00.460 --> 12:03.750
There's this grubby and ragged kid
over there who's about to die!

12:04.920 --> 12:08.380
Jeez, I really need to teach you
to have a little more tact in public...

12:08.380 --> 12:11.040
Hurry up! He's gonna die!

12:16.210 --> 12:18.330
What's wrong? Are you okay?

12:23.250 --> 12:25.500
This boy is very emaciated.

12:25.500 --> 12:27.790
Let's get him to a doctor right away.

12:28.460 --> 12:29.830
Prepare the coach!

12:29.830 --> 12:32.040
But, sir, that will make you late to the party...

12:32.040 --> 12:33.880
Just tell them that
I won't be attending tonight.

12:33.880 --> 12:34.960
As you wish.

12:40.080 --> 12:42.630
Cless just barely survived the night.

12:42.630 --> 12:45.460
It was so close that any later
and he would have died.

12:47.710 --> 12:50.290
The man who saved us was a noble.

12:50.290 --> 12:53.880
A member of the same hierarchy
that had made our lives a living hell.

12:54.040 --> 12:55.210
Thank you, sir! Thank you so much!

12:55.210 --> 12:58.500
But at that point,
none of it really mattered to me.
Thank you, sir! Thank you so much!<b></b>

12:58.960 --> 13:01.330
Gratitude was the only thing I felt.
I can't thank you enough!<b></b>

13:02.130 --> 13:05.880
Thank you so much! Thank you so much!

13:07.580 --> 13:09.540
From the day that we met those nobles,
our futures started to change drastically.

13:09.540 --> 13:11.830
Thank you so much...
From the day that we met those nobles,<b>
</b>our futures started to change drastically.<b></b>

13:11.830 --> 13:12.880
From the day that we met those nobles,
our futures started to change drastically.

13:15.790 --> 13:19.040
<b>15 Years Later</b>

13:24.830 --> 13:26.250
We can't hold the line any longer!

13:26.250 --> 13:27.040
Order a retreat!

13:27.040 --> 13:28.080
Don't be stupid!

13:28.080 --> 13:30.210
There'll be nowhere left for us to go
if they break through here!

13:30.210 --> 13:31.130
I know!

13:31.130 --> 13:34.130
But it's impossible to defeat these
monsters with the troops we have left!

13:34.130 --> 13:35.460
Retreating is not an option!

13:35.460 --> 13:38.460
Now act like a soldier
and keep fighting until the last man!

13:41.040 --> 13:43.710
N-no way! I don't wanna die!

13:43.710 --> 13:44.880
Have no fear!

13:55.080 --> 13:56.630
He took it down with one hit...

14:00.330 --> 14:02.380
We're saved! It's Cless!

14:02.960 --> 14:05.790
Captain Cless of the
Third Infantry Regiment is here!

14:16.080 --> 14:19.580
<b>Cless (Age 18)</b>

14:16.670 --> 14:18.330
We will defend this position!

14:21.000 --> 14:22.420
Cover us from the rear.

14:22.960 --> 14:23.750
Yessir!

14:23.750 --> 14:25.040
U-uh...

14:25.670 --> 14:26.920
Yessir!

14:28.920 --> 14:30.670
Leave no monster standing!

14:30.670 --> 14:33.170
Third Infantry Regiment!
Follow my lead!

14:35.420 --> 14:37.170
We'll join the charge, too!

14:45.920 --> 14:47.290
Captain Cless!

14:49.250 --> 14:51.080
We love you!

14:58.380 --> 15:01.460
<b>Helck (Age 22)</b>

15:02.250 --> 15:06.500
The nobleman who saved Cless was
a member of the prestigious Raphaed family,

15:06.500 --> 15:08.920
who've supported the royal family
since the kingdom's founding.

15:09.710 --> 15:11.500
On that day I sought help,

15:11.500 --> 15:15.330
the one and only person who
heard me out was their eldest daughter,

15:12.830 --> 15:15.790
<b>Daughter of Nobility</b>

15:12.830 --> 15:15.790
<b>Shalamy</b>

15:15.330 --> 15:16.460
Shalamy.

15:16.830 --> 15:17.670
Hey!

15:19.000 --> 15:21.040
Do you guys wanna play with me?
For whatever reason, she came to visit us<b>
</b>even after Cless got better<b></b>

15:21.040 --> 15:22.460
Yeah, that sounds fun.
For whatever reason, she came to visit us<b>
</b>even after Cless got better<b></b>

15:22.460 --> 15:24.130
What do you want to play?
and became our playmate.<b></b>

15:24.540 --> 15:25.920
She was an odd ball

15:25.920 --> 15:29.330
who never discriminated against the people
of the slum and just treated us normally.

15:29.330 --> 15:30.580
Let's race!

15:31.960 --> 15:34.250
After we started spending more time with her,

15:34.250 --> 15:37.130
the number of nobles who harassed us
became few and far between.

15:37.460 --> 15:39.670
They must have figured
we were Shalamy's friends,

15:39.670 --> 15:43.380
or actually, servants who
were working in her service.

15:43.380 --> 15:46.580
No matter the case,
it was truly comforting to me.

15:49.420 --> 15:52.130
But it left Cless with
a gloomy look on his face.

15:53.580 --> 15:57.170
Other people who we knew from the slums
were still facing awful hardships.

15:57.170 --> 15:59.170
That fact unsettled Cless

15:59.170 --> 16:02.290
and made him unable to take
any pleasure from our new situation.

16:02.670 --> 16:04.500
Remember what the old-timer said?

16:04.710 --> 16:06.710
As long as monsters plague the kingdom,

16:06.710 --> 16:08.880
the people of the capital
will always be stressed out.

16:08.880 --> 16:09.750
Right.

16:09.750 --> 16:11.880
And without any room to breathe,

16:11.880 --> 16:13.920
everyone will be focused on living their own lives,

16:13.920 --> 16:16.710
so even if someone tried to start a movement
against ending discrimination,

16:16.710 --> 16:18.460
nobody would join in.

16:19.380 --> 16:20.500
Right.

16:20.500 --> 16:24.540
Once the threat of the monsters goes away,
and tensions ease up in the kingdom,

16:24.540 --> 16:26.750
then the capital will become
a much better place!

16:27.000 --> 16:28.040
Right.

16:30.000 --> 16:33.170
Big Bro, I wanna become
a soldier someday!

16:33.170 --> 16:33.790
Huh?!

16:33.790 --> 16:37.040
I'm going to train to be an upstanding warrior
just like Shalamy's dad!

16:37.040 --> 16:39.330
And free everyone from
the terror of the monsters!

16:39.830 --> 16:40.880
Okay then!

16:40.880 --> 16:45.500
At the age of five, Cless began
following a path of his own choosing.

16:49.920 --> 16:54.920
And from that point onward,
he would train his body every day without fail.

16:59.500 --> 17:02.080
He joined the army at 16,

17:02.080 --> 17:06.250
and by the time he turned 18 he had
already been promoted to the rank of Captain.

17:11.210 --> 17:14.040
Wow. Great view from up here.

17:14.960 --> 17:17.170
Oh hey! Nice to see you, Mr. Raphaed!

17:17.170 --> 17:18.670
Greetings, Helck.

17:18.920 --> 17:21.580
I happened to catch sight of you
while passing by.

17:21.580 --> 17:22.880
Have you been well?

17:22.880 --> 17:23.880
Yes!

17:25.540 --> 17:29.080
It looks like Cless has really made
a name for himself this time.

17:29.750 --> 17:31.670
Whenever he goes out on the battlefield,

17:31.670 --> 17:34.130
I get the feeling the kingdom
grows a little bit brighter.

17:35.080 --> 17:37.630
Actually, it's more than just a feeling.

17:37.630 --> 17:41.830
The people of the kingdom have been
totally won over by his charisma.

17:42.000 --> 17:45.210
That tiny boy from all those years ago
grew into a warrior capable

17:45.210 --> 17:48.960
of easily defeating monsters that
any regular soldier would struggle against.

17:49.630 --> 17:53.210
Hell, I don't think even I could compete
with him at this point.

17:53.210 --> 17:56.000
That's impossible.
You're giving him too much credit!

17:56.960 --> 17:58.880
You don't have to humor me.

17:59.130 --> 18:01.670
Cless still has the potential to grow stronger.

18:01.670 --> 18:03.830
And I have no doubt that he will.

18:04.670 --> 18:10.420
I would even go as far as to say that Cless
may become the savior of this kingdom.

18:10.750 --> 18:12.960
A savior, you really think so?

18:14.170 --> 18:15.830
That idea is a lot to chew on!

18:15.830 --> 18:18.080
Helck! Where did Helck get off to?!

18:18.080 --> 18:18.960
He better stop slacking off!

18:18.960 --> 18:20.080
Uh-oh.
He better stop slacking off!<b></b>

18:20.080 --> 18:21.710
I need to get back to work.

18:22.540 --> 18:24.380
Sorry to take up your time.

18:26.960 --> 18:28.500
By the way, Helck.

18:28.500 --> 18:29.790
Yes?

18:30.000 --> 18:34.580
There's something special about you, too.
I can feel an indescribable power within you.

18:34.580 --> 18:38.250
Although, it may just be
my imagination at work.

18:38.630 --> 18:43.250
But I'm willing to bet that you're
just as strong as Cless is.

18:43.250 --> 18:44.630
Don't be ridiculous!

18:44.630 --> 18:48.330
I'm just a beefy guy because of
all the hard labor that I've been doing.

18:49.380 --> 18:52.920
And besides, my swordsmanship
pales in comparison to Cless.

18:52.920 --> 18:55.210
I'm an absolute amateur
when it comes to fighting.

18:56.670 --> 18:59.330
Casualties from monster attacks
are on the rise of late.

18:59.330 --> 19:03.080
There wouldn't be as much to worry about if we had
another powerful man like Cless on our side.

19:03.080 --> 19:04.880
Just a thought I had.

19:04.880 --> 19:06.080
I'm sorry.

19:06.080 --> 19:08.080
But it turns out that I'm just better suited

19:08.080 --> 19:10.580
to doing construction work
and repairs like I am now.

19:10.580 --> 19:11.830
Fair enough.

19:12.130 --> 19:14.420
That's an important job in its own right.

19:14.420 --> 19:15.880
Keep at it!

19:16.380 --> 19:17.920
Thinking about it now,

19:17.920 --> 19:20.920
that man was probably
picking up on my hero powers,

19:20.920 --> 19:23.170
even though I hadn't noticed them myself yet.

19:30.210 --> 19:32.040
Is that Cless and Shalamy?

19:32.790 --> 19:33.880
Oh, my.

19:34.830 --> 19:36.330
Oh, my, my!

19:37.380 --> 19:40.750
I might be crazy, but I think
the flowers of love are in bloom.

19:41.830 --> 19:44.540
Those two actually might
be more than just friends.

19:44.540 --> 19:46.250
But wait, since when?

19:46.420 --> 19:50.670
She's from a prestigious family of nobles.
So it's gonna be a tough road for them.

19:51.750 --> 19:55.210
But as his big brother,
I'm gonna lend Cless my full support!

19:55.710 --> 19:56.920
Hey, Cless?

19:56.920 --> 19:59.580
Your brother's standing here all alone
with a huge grin on his face.

19:59.580 --> 20:01.630
My brother's smile is perpetual.

20:01.630 --> 20:04.710
You two are always in
a real chipper mood, huh?

20:05.670 --> 20:07.330
Hey, there! Shalamy and Cless!

20:07.330 --> 20:10.250
Thanks for waiting.
I stumbled into Shalamy on my way here.

20:10.250 --> 20:10.500
I'm gonna join in on your fun!

20:10.500 --> 20:11.920
Circumstances had forced
Cless and I to live apart
I'm gonna join in on your fun!<b></b>

20:11.920 --> 20:12.460
Circumstances had forced
Cless and I to live apart
The more the merrier!<b></b>

20:12.460 --> 20:13.250
ever since he became a member of the army.
The more the merrier!<b></b>

20:13.250 --> 20:14.830
ever since he became a member of the army.
Let's hit up the usual place, Helck.<b></b>

20:14.830 --> 20:15.460
Sure!

20:15.460 --> 20:17.540
Although we didn't see each other often,

20:17.540 --> 20:21.460
we would occasionally find some time
to meet up and have dinner together.

20:21.460 --> 20:22.790
Cheers!

20:23.040 --> 20:25.080
The days that the
three of us spent together

20:25.080 --> 20:27.170
were some of the most enjoyable
that I can remember.

20:29.080 --> 20:33.960
Helck, I'm going to be leaving the capital for
another expedition the day after tomorrow.

20:34.790 --> 20:37.750
The monsters that we've been assigned
to take care of are particularly troublesome,

20:37.750 --> 20:40.330
so I might not be able
to come home for some time.

20:40.750 --> 20:42.000
Oh, really?

20:42.000 --> 20:43.580
Well, I'm not worried.

20:43.580 --> 20:46.330
I know you're skilled enough
to bring down any monster.

20:46.330 --> 20:47.920
Just be careful not to go overboard.

20:47.920 --> 20:51.540
If anything happened, I wouldn't be
the only person here to mourn your loss.

20:51.540 --> 20:52.380
Huh?

20:52.380 --> 20:53.710
Oh, of course.

20:55.710 --> 20:59.420
When I get back, I'd really love to have
some of your home cooking.

20:59.420 --> 21:00.460
Roger that!

21:00.460 --> 21:03.130
Then you can count on one of my
special stamina-booster meals

21:03.130 --> 21:04.790
to be waiting on the table for you!

21:05.420 --> 21:07.080
Make sure you come back alive!

21:07.080 --> 21:08.040
Right!

21:09.080 --> 21:10.250
However...

21:10.250 --> 21:13.540
we never got the chance to have
that welcome back party,

21:13.540 --> 21:15.170
because I couldn't stick around.

21:24.210 --> 21:27.830
Hey, what was that dream

21:27.830 --> 21:31.040
We used to fantasize about?

21:31.670 --> 21:35.630
A treasured memory even if it's small

21:35.630 --> 21:39.040
And covered in mud

21:39.790 --> 21:43.500
I was so clumsy that

21:43.500 --> 21:46.580
I couldn't even tell left from right

21:47.540 --> 21:54.460
When those clear eyes took my hand and saved me

21:55.540 --> 21:59.420
It's okay, it's okay, you kept saying

21:59.420 --> 22:03.330
As you hugged me tightly over and over

22:03.330 --> 22:06.710
This time I will be the one to grab ahold

22:06.710 --> 22:09.920
Of your warm hand

22:11.170 --> 22:18.330
I shouted your name and the world laughed

22:18.630 --> 22:22.580
Those words that hold us together

22:22.580 --> 22:25.710
Are the most precious of all

22:26.830 --> 22:34.040
If this is going to be our fate, then let's change it

22:34.290 --> 22:38.290
On the other side of the darkness

22:38.290 --> 22:45.290
We shall seize the light together

22:46.000 --> 22:50.790
<b>Next Episode</b>

22:46.000 --> 22:50.790
<b>The Mercenaries</b>

22:46.880 --> 22:49.460
Next time: "The Mercenaries"
